<title>HUNGARY: HUNGARY 1-MO BUBOR RATE 22.00 PCT, 3-MO 21.75 PCT.</title>
<headline>HUNGARY 1-MO BUBOR RATE 22.00 PCT, 3-MO 21.75 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-02-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rate (BUBOR) eased slightly for both the one-month and the three-month maturity compared to Friday, the National Bank of Hungary (NBH) said on Monday.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was fixed at 21.99 percent, down from 22.00 percent, while the three-month rate was 21.74 percent, down from 21.75 percent, the NBH said.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
</text>
